1b:T49b,{"@context":"https://schema.org","@graph":[{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-modeles-open-source#webpage","url":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-modeles-open-source","name":"Modèles open source agent IA B2B | Guide 2025","description":"Découvrez les meilleurs modèles open source (LLaMA 3, Mistral, Qwen) pour construire des agents IA B2B performants et maîtriser vos coûts en 2025.","inLanguage":"fr-FR","isPartOf":{"@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/#website"},"about":{"@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/#organization"},"breadcrumb":{"@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-modeles-open-source#breadcrumb"}},{"@type":"BreadcrumbList","itemListElement":[{"@type":"ListItem","position":1,"name":"Accueil","item":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":2,"name":"Ressources agent IA","item":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia"},{"@type":"ListItem","position":3,"name":"Modèles open source pour agents IA B2B","item":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-modeles-open-source"}],"@id":"https://pulse.smatchroom.com/agent-ia/agent-ia-modeles-open-source#breadcrumb"}]}12:[["$","script",null,{"type":"application/ld+json","dangerouslySetInnerHTML":{"__html":"$1b"}}],["$","$L1c",null,{}],["$","article",null,{"className":"mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-16 sm:px-6","children":[["$","nav",null,{"className":"mb-6 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]","children":[["$","$L1d",null,{"href":"/","children":"Accueil"}]," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2","children":"›"}],["$","$L1d",null,{"href":"/agent-ia","children":"Agent IA"}]," ",["$","span",null,{"className":"mx-2","children":"›"}],["$","span",null,{"children":"Modèles open source pour agents IA B2B"}]]}],["$","h1",null,{"className":"mb-4 text-balance text-3xl font-semibold leading-tight sm:text-4xl","children":"Modèles open source pour agents IA B2B"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"mb-12 text-sm text-[var(--muted)]","children":["Publié le ","13/05/2026"," · ",12," min de lecture"," · ",["$","span",null,{"className":"font-mono","children":"modèles open source agent ia"}]]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"article-body","children":[["$","p",null,{"children":["Pour construire un agent IA B2B performant tout en maîtrisant vos coûts, les modèles open source les plus adaptés en 2025 sont ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"LLaMA 3"}]," (Meta), ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Mistral 7B / Mixtral 8x7B"}],", ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Qwen 2.5"}]," (Alibaba) et ",["$","strong",null,{"children":"Phi-3"}]," (Microsoft). Ils offrent des licences commerciales exploitables, des performances proches des modèles propriétaires sur les tâches structurées, et la possibilité d'un déploiement sur votre propre infrastructure."]}],"\n",["$","h2",null,{"id":"quels-modèles-open-source-choisir-pour-un-agent-ia-b2b-en-2025-","children":["$","a",null,{"href":"#quels-modèles-open-source-choisir-pour-un-agent-ia-b2b-en-2025-","children":"Quels modèles open source choisir pour un agent IA B2B en 2025 ?"}]}],"\n",["$","p",null,{"children":"En 2025, quatre familles de modèles dominent les déploiements d'agents IA en contexte B2B :"}],"\n",["$","ul",null,{"children":["\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"LLaMA 3 (8B / 70B)"}]," — référence de Meta, licence commerciale permissive, excellent rapport performance/coût"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Mistral 7B / Mixtral 8x7B"}]," — modèles français, très efficaces sur les tâches de raisonnement et de génération structurée"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Qwen 2.5 (7B à 72B)"}]," — forte performance sur les tâches multilingues et les contextes longs"]}],"\n",["$","li",null,{"children":[["$","strong",null,{"children":"Phi-3 (Microsoft)"}]," — modèle compact (3,8B), optimisé pour l'inférence locale à faible coût"]}],"\n"]}],"\n","$L1e","\n","$L1f","\n","$L20","\n","$L21","\n","$L22","\